  "design": "Four dataset-validation jobs start together in separate workstations over one persistent customer analysis system. Each can file one routine segment validation and reaches one current codebook entry whose exact route is held by another workstation. After live communication forms, the same agents publish distinct demand slices. A shared cohort record can be transferred through ordinary analysis activity; the publisher shows regional customer records and that slice's inventory request without a global projected deduplication result. Regional systems expose their own source keys; the parent register gives the ingested record count while profile mapping is pending. Independent entity truth recomputes customer double count and inventory overallocation.",
